        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三支一扶江西省情归纳</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #e5e5e5;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .phone {\n    width: 550px;\n    background: #fff;\n    min-height: 700px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  }\n  /* Status bar */\n  .status-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 8px 18px 4px 18px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .status-bar .dots {\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  /* App toolbar */\n  .app-toolbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 6px 16px 10px 16px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .app-toolbar .icons {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n  .app-toolbar .done {\n    color: #d99a2b;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .date-line {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    padding: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  /* Content */\n  .content {\n    padding: 6px 22px 90px 22px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .intro {\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .heading2 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 12px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  ul.l1 {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding-left: 0;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  ul.l1 > li {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  ul.l1 > li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  ul.l2 {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  ul.l2 > li {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    position: relative;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  ul.l2 > li::before {\n    content: \"◦\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  ul.l3 {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  ul.l3 > li {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  ul.l3 > li::before {\n    content: \"▪\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .species-row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n  /* Bottom keyboard toolbar */\n  .keyboard-toolbar {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    background: #d5d7db;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .kb-icon {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .kb-suggest {\n    flex: 1;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .kb-suggest span {\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .kb-mic {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .kb-aa {\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .corner-tag {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 20px;\n    bottom: 46px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"phone\">\n\n  <div class=\"status-bar\">\n    <span>19:46 6月2日周五</span>\n    <span class=\"dots\">•••</span>\n    <span>69% 🔋</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"app-toolbar\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:18px;\">🗂</span>\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>Aa</span>\n      <span>◐</span>\n      <span>📋</span>\n      <span>🗒</span>\n      <span>📷</span>\n      <span>🔗</span>\n      <span>⊕</span>\n      <span>⋯</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"done\">完成</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"date-line\">2023年6月2日 19:44</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"title\">三支一扶江西省情归纳</div>\n\n    <div class=\"intro\">江西：因唐玄宗设江南西道而得省名，又因母亲河为赣江而得简称</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">第一 江西地理资源</div>\n\n    <ul class=\"l1\">\n      <li>位置面积（16.69万平方米）\n        <ul class=\"l2\">\n          <li>位于中国东南部，长江中下游南岸</li>\n          <li>东邻浙江、福建，南邻广东，西毗湖南，北毗湖北、安徽（6个省）</li>\n          <li>为珠三角、长三角、海峡西岸的中心腹地</li>\n          <li>截止2023年，江西省辖11个地级市，27个直辖市、12个县级市、61个县，合计100个县级区划</li>\n          <li>2022年末，江西常住人口4527.98万人</li>\n          <li>吴头楚尾，粤户闽庭（地理位置好，有优势，是交通枢纽又是兵家必争之地）</li>\n          <li>中国山水的\"形胜之区\"，襟三江而带五湖，控蛮荆而引瓯越</li>\n          <li>素有\"文章节义之邦，白鹤鱼米之国\"之美称</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n\n      <li style=\"margin-top:14px;\">地形地貌\n        <ul class=\"l2\">\n          <li>山地（36%）、丘陵（东南丘陵）（42%）、平原（12%）、水域（10%）</li>\n          <li>山脉分布于省境边陲，东北部怀玉山、东部武夷山、南部大庾岭喃九连山、西部罗霄山脉、西北部幕阜山和九岭山</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n\n      <li style=\"margin-top:14px;\">气候降水\n        <ul class=\"l2\">\n          <li>位于长江以南，纬度较低，属于亚热带风湿润气候</li>\n          <li>冬季空气活动频繁，春季多对流性天气</li>\n          <li>4～6月降水集中，年降水量1341～1939ml，年平均降水量1675ml</li>\n          <li>年平均气温18.0摄氏度，最冷月1月平均温度6.1摄氏度，最热月7月平均温度28.8摄氏度</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n\n      <li style=\"margin-top:14px;\">自然资源\n        <ul class=\"l2\">\n          <li>生物资源\n            <ul class=\"l3\">\n              <li>已知高等植物6337种</li>\n              <li>叶木莲（木莲属唯一落叶的植物）分布于宜春 我省有特有种</li>\n              <li>东乡县野生稻 近代水稻始祖 我国分布最北的野生稻</li>\n              <li>\n                <div class=\"species-row\">\n                  <span>南昌—金荞麦</span>\n                  <span>鄞阳—湖莼菜</span>\n                  <span>彭泽—中华水韭</span>\n                  <span>宜黄（江西抚州）</span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <div class=\"species-row\">\n                  <span>一水蕨</span>\n                  <span>赣南—野生茶</span>\n                  <span>九江—野生莲均为国内珍稀物种</span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"corner-tag\">杉</div>\n\n  <div class=\"keyboard-toolbar\">\n    <span class=\"kb-icon\">▦</span>\n    <span class=\"kb-icon\">◫</span>\n    <div class=\"kb-suggest\">\n      <span>我</span>\n      <span>为</span>\n      <span>自己</span>\n      <span>是</span>\n      <span>其</span>\n      <span>在</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"kb-mic\">🎤</span>\n    <span class=\"kb-aa\">Aa</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
